<title>SPAIN: FORECAST - Telefonica 96 net seen up 20.2 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Telefonica 96 net seen up 20.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for consolidated results for the full year 1996 of Telefonica de Espana S.A.</p>
<p>In millions or billions of pesetas, as specified.</p>
<p>				 1996	1995	    RANGE</p>
<p>Net attributable (million)  159.90    133.05     158.70-160.00</p>
<p>Operating</p>
<p>income (bln)		  1.96	1.73     1.92 bln-2.00 bln</p>
<p>Operating</p>
<p>margin (bln)		  1.09	1.01     1.05 bln-1.11 bln</p>
<p>Contributors: Six national and international analysts contributed to the survey. Analysts and houses will remain anonymous because of the current sale of the state's remaining 20.9 percent stake in the group.</p>
<p>The group will release highlights from its results on Wednesday after market close. Full results are due at the end of February.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2196</p>
</text>
